    <briefdescription>
<para>Core engine class responsible for window creation and SDL lifecycle. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classEngine" kindref="compound">Engine</ref> class abstracts the low-level window management and SDL initialization. It owns the <ref refid="classSDLWindow" kindref="compound">SDLWindow</ref> and manages the main loop&apos;s running state.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classSDLWindow" kindref="compound">SDLWindow</ref>, <ref refid="classApplication" kindref="compound">Application</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
